1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,564
Do you see yourself as someone who
surrenders?

2
00:00:03,684 --> 00:00:06,784
Right now, I don’t want to
surrender.

3
00:00:11,084 --> 00:00:14,384
What are you working toward?

4
00:00:16,084 --> 00:00:21,884
Specifically, I don’t want to be a
programmer anymore.

5
00:00:21,884 --> 00:00:27,024
I want to try creating comedy.

6
00:00:28,084 --> 00:00:33,664
Stand-up, sketches, improv—I want
to try them all.

7
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:37,001
I heard this at a training class.

8
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:41,841
Someone told me how to write good
stand-up:

9
00:00:41,841 --> 00:00:47,801
Build up enough negative feelings,
and the material comes pouring
out.

10
00:00:47,801 --> 00:00:55,441
But that’s not really what I want
to write.

11
00:00:55,441 --> 00:01:05,561
I want to find small, interesting
things in everyday life.

12
00:01:07,441 --> 00:01:10,481
Not just complain and vent.
